Note on Bundled Derived Data Tables:
Derived advisory catalogs and aggregate census tables under `data/` and `results/`
originate from public open-source archives (GitHub Advisory Database, OSV, OpenSSF
Malicious Packages, and ecosyste.ms Open Data) and are distributed under
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0) / CC BY-SA 4.0
consistent with their upstream licenses (see DATA.md and DATA_MANIFEST.json).
